# The bundled task queue (docs/workflow-surface.md decision 6): the signed-in user's open
# workflow tasks of this application, served at /_tesseraql/tasks by the runtime that serves the
# application — a hosted member included, because a workflow task is the application's business
# data and the detail pages the queue links into are the application's routes. Session-only by
# design.
config/tesseraql.yml
web/_tesseraql/tasks/get.yml
web/_tesseraql/tasks/tasks.html
